{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedReadbackFold","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedReadbackFold","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SchenstedReadback"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qRowOf_qAppendSteps_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qRowOf_qAppendSteps_zero","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedReadbackFold.lean#L101-L106","doc":"**At the empty tableau**, the form the RSK inverse consumes: reading timestamp `k` off `Q`\nreturns the row the `k`-th letter's insertion appended to. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qRowOf_qAppendSteps","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qRowOf_qAppendSteps","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedReadbackFold.lean#L85-L99","doc":"**The read-back.** Under the freshness invariant, timestamp `s + k` sits in the row that the\n`k`-th step wrote to — so the index list is recoverable from the recording tableau. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qRowOf_qAppendSteps_of_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.qRowOf_qAppendSteps_of_lt","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedReadbackFold.lean#L76-L83","doc":"**Later appends never move an earlier timestamp.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.allLt_qAppend","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.allLt_qAppend","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedReadbackFold.lean#L68-L74","doc":"The invariant survives an append, with the counter bumped. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.mem_qAppend","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.mem_qAppend","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedReadbackFold.lean#L42-L66","doc":"**An append adds only its own timestamp.** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.not_mem_of_allLt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.not_mem_of_allLt","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedReadbackFold.lean#L37-L40","doc":"`AllLt Q s` says in particular that `s` itself is absent — the freshness `qRowOf_qAppend_self`\nwants. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.allLt_nil","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.allLt_nil","kind":"theorem","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedReadbackFold.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.AllLt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.Schensted.AllLt","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SchenstedReadbackFold.lean#L31-L33","doc":"Every entry of `Q` is strictly below `s` — the freshness invariant, in the form that\npropagates. ","signatureChunk":0}]}